---
title: Detached start · pool watch
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px

    [*] --> unobserved
    unobserved --> watching : record running
    unobserved --> unobserved : starting, stopped, unreadable
    watching --> watching : same boot, slow, unreadable
    watching --> grace : boot ended
    grace --> done : start returns
    grace --> exited : 10 s pass
    watching --> done : start returns
    done --> [*]
    exited --> [*]

    note right of watching
        Pool identity: owner token
        and guest boot id, checked
        every 5 s.
    end note
    note right of exited
        Marker released, process
        exits as a crash would; the
        next up recovers the run.
    end note

    class watching ok
    class grace wait
    class exited fail
